*.npz
*.csv
__pycache__/
*.log
.venv/
*.parquet
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
# The law and scenario config tree is versioned text, not data: the blanket
# CSV ignore above is for model data files, so carve config back in.
!config/**/*.csv
# The top-tax dial legends are the join key between the runscript and the
# surrogate fitter (scenario ID to dial settings), generated alongside the
# config tree — versioned text, not model data.
!projects/top_tax/*_legend.csv
# The golden law fixtures are compiled tax parameters and index series -- no
# microdata in them -- and the tests need them on any machine, including CI.
!tests/golden/fixtures/**/*.csv
!tests/golden/fixtures/**/*.npz
# Same reasoning for resources/: pre-1970 CPI-U annual averages as BLS
# published them. A fixed historical record the model reads, not model data.
!resources/*.csv
# Internal working notes. They stay in the working tree but are not published.
CLAUDE.md
CRUFT.md
REMAINING_TODOS.md
docs/RULINGS.md
docs/MODEL_FIXES_TODO.md
memos/
# Report drafts and result archives kept beside the top-tax scripts.
projects/top_tax/*.md
projects/top_tax/*.zip
